Algility is the company I founded in 2024. We build AI-native systems for sales, growth, and customer acquisition.

Most teams already have the tools. CRM, inbox, sheets, a couple AI subscriptions. The mess is everything between them. People become the integration layer, and that's expensive.

We wire the path so a lead doesn't die in a tab and follow-up doesn't depend on memory. If you want the product site, it's [algility.com](https://algility.com/). If you want the builder version of the story, that's me.
